        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Building on our commercialization experience and infrastructure in the PRC, we have expanded our presence into the United States to advance the clinical development of our innovative pipeline, including F351 (Hydronidone), our lead product candidate for liver fibrosis.",
        "start_character": 1359,
        "end_character": 1628
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106251",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106251-e1188444132b3df5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106251",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For details, see “—Our Operations in the PRC: Gyre Pharmaceuticals—Government Regulations in the PRC —Regulations Relating to the Development, Manufacture and Sale of Pharmaceuticals—Drug Distribution and Two-Invoice System.” To comply with these relevant regulations, we primarily adopt the single-layer distribution model with distributors who directly on-sell our products to hospitals and public medical institutions.",
