        "statement": "See the risk factor entitled “Manufacturing pharmaceutical products on a large commercial scale is highly exacting and complex, and we and our third-party manufacturers may encounter problems during the process.”",
        "start_character": 38494,
        "end_character": 38706
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106251",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106251-e1188444132b3df5",
